// "Manifest <card>" [CR#701.40a]: turn it face down; it becomes a 2/2
// face-down creature card with no text, no name, no subtypes and no mana cost,
// and is put onto the battlefield face down. The face-down characteristics are
// the move's rider (`FaceDown`) [CR#708.2]. Turning it face up is a special
// action the rules give its controller [CR#701.40b,116.2b], not part of the
// instruction.
KeywordAction(
    name: "manifest",
    params: [Subject],
    spelling: "manifest <Param(0)>",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "manifest",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
    body: putOntoBattlefieldFaceDown(Param(0), (types: [Creature], power: 2, toughness: 2)),
)
